  "title": "A New Chapter Deserves a New Brand: Introducing The Bloom",
  "summary": "Nourish has evolved significantly as both a product and a company, and it became clear to us that the brand needed to evolve alongside it. We wanted something simple, calm, and distinctly human; a brand that could scale across many forms of care without feeling overly clinical. Our new mark, the Bloom, reflects that thinking: different parts working together in balance—a nod to guidance, care, and healthier living over time.",
